Experimental native D3DMetal callback and window bridge for Wine 11.21.
Derived from Switchyard Wine revision 34a09170d3754522dc55416617c6754dd2d9a086,
with the GPTK 4 beta 3 callback, SDK, jump-stub, scalar-float and NGX repairs.
Source: https://github.com/jungwuk-ryu/switchyard-wine
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later; retain Wine and downstream source notices.
Apply after the Wine 11.21 Steam redirect and DXMT Metal-view patches.
Rebuild both Windows ntdll images, Unix ntdll.so and native winemac.so.

